        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>参考答案</title>\n<style>\n    html, body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        background: #ffffff;\n    }\n\n    body {\n        font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", \"宋体\", serif;\n        color: #222;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n        position: relative;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        width: 540px;\n        height: 764px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        background: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .title {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 72px;\n        left: 0;\n        width: 100%;\n        margin: 0;\n        text-align: center;\n        font-family: \"SimSun\", \"宋体\", serif;\n        font-size: 21px;\n        line-height: 28px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    .content {\n        position: absolute;\n        z-index: 2;\n        top: 108px;\n        left: 49px;\n        width: 446px;\n        font-size: 11px;\n        line-height: 21.5px;\n        font-weight: 400;\n    }\n\n    .line {\n        height: 21.5px;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .detail {\n        font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .watermark {\n        position: absolute;\n        z-index: 1;\n        top: 318px;\n        left: 203px;\n        width: 150px;\n        height: 66px;\n        opacity: 0.075;\n        color: #687178;\n        transform: rotate(-17deg);\n        pointer-events: none;\n    }\n\n    .watermark .arc {\n        position: absolute;\n        border: 2px solid #687178;\n        border-right-color: transparent;\n        border-bottom-color: transparent;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        transform: rotate(28deg);\n    }\n\n    .watermark .arc.one {\n        top: 4px;\n        left: 5px;\n        width: 82px;\n        height: 50px;\n    }\n\n    .watermark .arc.two {\n        top: 10px;\n        left: 12px;\n        width: 69px;\n        height: 42px;\n    }\n\n    .watermark .arc.three {\n        top: 16px;\n        left: 20px;\n        width: 55px;\n        height: 33px;\n    }\n\n    .watermark .wm-text {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 29px;\n        left: 72px;\n        width: 78px;\n        font-family: \"SimSun\", \"宋体\", serif;\n        font-size: 15px;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .footer {\n        position: absolute;\n        left: 0;\n        bottom: 44px;\n        width: 100%;\n        text-align: center;\n        color: #555;\n        font-family: \"SimSun\", \"宋体\", serif;\n        font-size: 9px;\n        line-height: 14px;\n    }\n</style>\n<script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n        tex: {\n            inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n            displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n        }\n    };\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n    <h1 class=\"title\">参考答案：</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <div class=\"arc one\"></div>\n        <div class=\"arc two\"></div>\n        <div class=\"arc three\"></div>\n        <div class=\"wm-text\">[illegible]</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <main class=\"content\">\n        <div class=\"line\">1．A</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"detail\">【详解】</span>句意：许多衣服正在特价出售，但是很少是好的。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">few 很少的，修饰可数名词；a few 一些，修饰可数名词；little 很少的，修饰不可数名词；a</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">little 一点，修饰不可数名词。根据 many clothes 是可数名词，故排除 CD 两项。根据 but 可知，</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">前半句表示很多衣服在低价出售，后半句表示它们很少是好的，故用 few，故选 A。</div>\n\n        <div class=\"line\">2．B</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"detail\">【详解】</span>试题分析：句意：--你最喜欢谁，科比，詹姆斯还是乔丹？--都不喜欢。林书豪是我</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">最喜欢的篮球运动员。分析：考查代词的用法，all 三者以上都；none 三者以上都不；each 每</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">一个；either 两者中的任何一个。分析：选项中提到的是三个人，通过答语体现三者都不喜欢，</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">因此选择代词 none.故选 B</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">考点：考查代词的用法。</div>\n\n        <div class=\"line\">3．B</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"detail\">【详解】</span>句意：迈克有两个姐妹。她们俩都不喜欢牛奶，但他非常喜欢。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">考查代词。None(三者或三者以上)都不；Neither 两者都不；Each 每个。根据“Mike has two sisters.”</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">可知，此处指的是“two sisters”，再结合“but he loves it very much.”可知，前句说的是两个姐妹</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">都不喜欢牛奶，故选 B。</div>\n\n        <div class=\"line\">4．B</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"detail\">【详解】</span>句意“我们仍然有一点鸡蛋在冰箱里”。a bit 和 a little 修饰形容词、副词、动词或比较</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">级，排除 A 和 D；egg 为可数名词，much 修饰不可数名词，排除 C，a few 译为“有一点”，修</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">饰可数名词，表示肯定。故选 B。</div>\n\n        <div class=\"line\">5．C</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"detail\">【详解】</span>句意：——Sally，你还想吃点别的吗？——不，谢谢。我现在饱了。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">考查复合不定代词以及形容词的位置。anything 任何事物；nothing 没什么；something 某物。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">形容词 else 修饰不定代词时，要放在其后，排除 A 和 D 选项。此句是表示请求的疑问句，应</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">用 something，故选 C。</div>\n\n        <div class=\"line\">6．C</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"detail\">【详解】</span>句意：政府正在努力改善老年人的生活，因为他们中许多人正遭受孤独或是身体不佳；</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">答案第1页，共7页</footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
